          "ruleId": "CVE-2026-65912",
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "CVE-2026-65912 - DOMPurify's ADD_ATTR predicate function mechanism (via EXTRA_ELEMENT_HANDLING.attributeCheck) short-circuits URI validation when the predicate returns true. This allows unsafe protocols such as javascript: to survive sanitization in href and similar attributes, enabling DOM-based XSS when such links are activated."
          },
