          "message": {
            "text": "CVE-2026-65914 - DOMPurify is vulnerable to mutation-XSS (mXSS) when sanitized HTML is embedded into special raw-text wrapper elements such as xmp, script, iframe, noembed, noframes, or noscript before being assigned via innerHTML. Attacker-controlled sequences like <\/xmp> inside attribute values close the raw-text context during the second parse, causing the sanitized output to mutate into executable markup."
